#Belt, Monk's						KEY:Belt (Monk's)																						TYPE:Magic.Wondrous.Belt																									COST:13000	WT:1																		SOURCEPAGE:p.248	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Monk ~ AC Bonus	ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|Monk ~ Unarmed Damage																																																																																																		BONUS:VAR|MonkACLVL|5	BONUS:VAR|StunningFistAttackTimes|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Stunning Fist	BONUS:VAR|MonkUnarmedDamageLVL|5																																																																																																																						SPROP:This simple rope belt, when wrapped around a character's waist, confers great ability in unarmed combat. The wearer's AC and unarmed damage is treated as a monk of five levels higher. If donned by a character with the Stunning Fist feat, the belt lets her make one additional stunning attack per day. If the character is not a monk, she gains the AC and unarmed damage of a 5th-level monk. This AC bonus functions just like the monk's AC bonus. Moderate transmutation; CL 10th
Monk's Belt (Battledancer)			DESC:This is a standard Monk's belt, but with the Unarmed Damage ability removed to keep it from breaking damage calculations when worn by a Battle Dancer.																							TYPE:Magic.Wondrous.Belt																									COST:13000	WT:1																		SOURCEPAGE:p.248	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Monk ~ AC Bonus																																																																																																			BONUS:VAR|MonkACLVL|5	BONUS:VAR|StunningFistAttackTimes|1|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Stunning Fist	BONUS:VAR|MonkUnarmedDamageLVL|5	BONUS:VAR|BattleDancerUnarmedDamageLVL|5																																																																																																																						SPROP:This simple rope belt, when wrapped around a character's waist, confers great ability in unarmed combat. The wearer's AC and unarmed damage is treated as a monk of five levels higher. If donned by a character with the Stunning Fist feat, the belt lets her make one additional stunning attack per day. If the character is not a monk, she gains the AC and unarmed damage of a 5th-level monk. This AC bonus functions just like the monk's AC bonus. Moderate transmutation; CL 10th